@startuml
' A group's colors: its tab (`alt#Gold`), the part before the first
' `else` (`#LightBlue`) and each `else` (`#Pink`), under the lifelines;
' a group inside keeps its own on top.
Shopper -> Shop : pay
alt#Gold #LightBlue card accepted
    Shop -> Bank : charge
    loop #LightYellow each item
        Shop -> Stock : take
    end
else #Pink declined
    Shop --> Shopper : try again
end
@enduml
